        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions Decorative Urn Tip Acrylic Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe detailed filigree urn tip end brackets of this truly unique decorative door handle will add incredible beauty along with long life functionally to any door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest  acrylic available. The acrylic is manufacture with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading. Available in your choice of <b>Frosted or Crystal Clear Acrylic</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nThese are great for <a href=\"/products/urn-tip-acrylic-appliance-handle-first-impressions-cf-mgrburnax\">appliance handles</a>, <a href=\"/products/12-inch-decorative-acrylic-glass-door-handles-pair-first-impressions-fii-sd-mgrburnax-12\">glass door handles</a> and <a href=\"/collections/storefront-door-hardware\">store front doors</a>.\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions MGRBURNAx Acrylic Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Finest Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>FII-MGRBURNA12: Total Length 12\" - Center to Center Mount: 7-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-MGRBURNA18: Total Length 18\" - Center to Center Mount: 13-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-MGRBURNA20: Total Length 20\" - Center to Center Mount: 15-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-MGRBURNA24: Total Length 24\" - Center to Center Mount: 19-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This decorative door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br><br>\r\n<b>** Item Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/acrylic-collection\">First Impressions Acrylic Door Pulls</a></b>\r\n<br><br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Decorative Urn Tip Acrylic Door Handle, First Impressions MGRBURNAx",
                "description": "First Impressions MGRBURNAx Acrylic  Door Handles. Available in 12, 18, 20 and 24 inches long in your choice of clear or frosted acrylic. These decorative urn tip acrylic door pulls are truly unique design. They will add incredible beauty along with long life functionally to any door.",
